# Reserved for future service configuration. Do not add secrets to this file.

# Live generation stays disabled until a trusted Vercel deployment and shared
# Upstash Redis REST limiter are configured. Demo mode does not need them.
# OPENAI_TEXT_MODEL defaults to gpt-6-luna.
# Configure OPENAI_API_KEY, UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL, and
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN in the deployment's secret settings.
# OPENAI_TRANSCRIBE_MODEL defaults to gpt-transcribe.
# OPENAI_SPEECH_MODEL defaults temporarily to gpt-4o-mini-tts; migrate this
# adapter to gpt-realtime-2.1-mini before its scheduled 2027-01-06 shutdown.
